    <title>Unity Gateway screens MCP tool calls for jailbreaks</title>
    <updated>2026-10-21T00:00:00.000Z</updated>
    <link href="https://www.enterpriseai.tools/updates/#update-2026-10-21-09" />
    <summary>Unity Gateway can now screen MCP tool calls and their results for jailbreak and prompt-injection attempts in beta, with the Jailbreak guardrail applied to input, output or both.</summary>
